  "notes": "## 0.2.0-alpha.6 - 2026-03-09\n\n### Features\n\n- Add in-app release notes rendering with bilingual update notes support based on the user's language\n- Add circular reveal and collapse animations when entering or leaving Settings\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fix empty update release notes by populating the updater manifest from the changelog files\n- Fix page navigation skeleton flashes so cached content stays visible during background refresh\n- Fix slow macOS image sync by converting clipboard TIFF images to PNG before transfer\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.2.0-alpha.6 - 2026-03-09\n\n### Features\n\n- 新增应用内 release notes 展示能力，并支持根据用户语言显示双语更新说明\n- 新增设置页进入和退出时的圆形展开与收拢动画\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复更新弹窗 release notes 为空的问题，改为从 changelog 文件填充更新清单\n- 修复页面切换时骨架屏闪烁的问题，在后台刷新期间保留已缓存内容\n- 修复 macOS 图片同步过慢的问题，发送前会先将剪贴板 TIFF 图片转换为 PNG",
